{"id":"P052-1","subject":"P","unit":"P052","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P052-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n두 벡터가 각각 , 일 때,\n\n⦁는?\n\n\n① 0           ② 1\n\n③ 2           ④ 3","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1155}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n자기 인덕턴스가 각각 mH, mH 인 두 개의 코일\n\n을 동일한 방향으로 직렬 접속하였을 때 합성 인덕턴스가\n\n60mH, 하나를 반대방향으로 접속하였을 때 합성 인덕턴스\n\n가 40mH 일 때, 두 코일의 상호 인덕턴스는 몇 mH인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":727},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1163}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n전계가 Vm인 공간중에서 의 위치에\n존재하는 C의 전하를 의 위치로 이동시켰을 때의\n일은 몇 J인가?\n\n\n① ×        ② × \n③ ×        ④ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":506},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":672}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n전위함수가 V로 주어질 때, (3, 0, 0)에서 체적\n전하밀도는 몇 Cm인가?\n\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":581},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1027}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n권수가 100회이고, 반지름이 20cm인 원형코일 중심\n\n자계가 200ATm일 때, 코일에 흐르는 전류는 몇 A\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 0.8          ② 1.2\n\n③ 1.6          ④ 2.4","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":855}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n극판사이에 유전율이 Fm인 매질로 채워진 평행판\n\n콘덴서가 있다. 극판사이에 있는 기존의 매질을 유전율이\nFm인 매질로 바꾸어 채우는 경우, 전하량의 변화는\n\n어떻게 되는가?\n(단, 이며, 전압이 일정하다고 한다.)        \n\n① 배가 된다.     ② 배가 된다.                                            \n③  배가 된다.    ④ 변화없다.       ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":612},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n다음 그림과 같이 무한평면도체로부터 수직거리로 1m\n\n되는 위치에 진전하 C이 있을 때, 위치에서\n전계 는 몇 Vm인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n                            \n①            ②     \n\n                            \n③            ④                              ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":1103},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1478}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n다음 회로에서 각 정전용량이 F, F,\nF, F일 때, 회로의 합성 정전용량은\n\n몇 F인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 6           ② 6.2\n\n③ 7           ④ 7.6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":779},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":404}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n반지름이 6m이고, 비유전율이 4인 구도체에 C의 전\n하를 충전하였을 때, 구도체의 분극의 세기는 몇 Cm인\n\n가?\n\n\n             \n①            ②     \n\n             \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m09-q.webp","width":696,"height":670},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":961}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n우리나라는 중성점 유효접지 방식을 채택하고 있다.\n\n그 이유는 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 전압강하의 감소    ② 송전용량의 증가\n\n③ 단락전류의 제한    ④ 건전상의 전위상승 억제","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":921}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n660kVA, 6600/440V의 단상변압기의 2차측을 단락\n\n하고 1차측에 330V를 인가하면 2차측에 100A 의 전\n\n류가 흐른다. 정격상태에서 2차측에 단락사고 발생시의\n\n단락전류는 몇 kA 인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":570},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1088}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n경간이 200m, 수평장력이 1000kg, 하중이 0.5kgm\n\n인 가공전선의 이도는 몇 m인가?\n\n\n① 1.5          ② 2.0\n\n③ 2.5          ④ 3.0","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m12-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":794}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n파동임피던스가 Ω, Ω인 두 선로가\n\n접속되어 있을 때, 두 선로의 접속점(변이점) 에서\n\n반사계수와 투과계수는?\n\n\n\n\n\n       반사계수        투과계수\n\n ①           0.5                  1.25\n\n ②           0.5                   1.5\n\n ③           0.8                  1.25\n\n ④           0.8                   1.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":960},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1469}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n다음 중 송전선로의 전압조정장치에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 조속기        ② AVR\n\n③ 전력용 콘덴서     ④ 전력용 리액터","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":400},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m14-e1.webp","width":696,"height":413}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n화력발전소에서 절탄기의 용도는 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n① 연소용 공기를 예열한다.\n\n② 포화증기를 과열한다.\n\n③ 보일러에 공급되는 급수를 예열한다.\n\n④ 석탄을 건조한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m15-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n수차의 특유속도가 크다는 것의 의미는 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 수차의 실용속도가 높은 것을 의미한다.\n\n② 수차러너와 유수와의 상대속도가 빠름을 의미한다.\n\n③ 경부하시의 효율 저하가 거의 없음을 의미한다.\n\n④ 수차러너의 속도변동률이 큰 것을 의미한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1107}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n동기기의 단락비가 큰 경우와 작은 경우의 특징에 대한\n\n설명으로 잘못된 것은?\n\n\n① 단락비가 큰 기계는 계자자속이 크다.\n\n② 단락비가 큰 기계는 송전선의 충전용량이 크다.\n\n③ 단락비가 작은 기계는 전기자 반작용이 작다.\n\n④ 단락비가 작은 기계는 과부하 내량이 작다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":775}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음의 현상은 동기 발전기에서 어떤 것에 의한 제한으로\n\n나타나는 현상인가?\n\n\n   ㉠ 저여자 운전시 발전기 내부 기전력 감소\n\n   ㉡ 부하각 증대에 의한 동기화력 감소\n\n   ㉢ 계통 동요로 인한 발전기의 탈조 가능성\n\n\n\n① 고정자 권선 과열에 의한 제한\n\n② 회전자 과열에 의한 제한\n\n③ 고정자 철심 과열에 의한 제한\n\n④ 안정도에 의한 제한","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m18-q.webp","width":678,"height":739},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":523}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n전기자 도체수가 500, 극수가 4인 단중 파권 직류 발전\n\n기가 1200rpm으로 회전할 때, 전기자의 유기 기전력이\n\n400V일 때, 발전기 계자의 극당 자속은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 0.01         ② 0.02\n\n③ 0.04         ④ 0.05","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1359}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n정격이 5kW, 100V, 50A , 1200rpm인 분권 직류\n\n발전기가 있다. 무부하시와 정격시의 단자전압 차는 몇 V\n\n인가?\n\n(단, 계자전류는 5A, 전기자 저항은 0.2Ω이고, 브러시\n\n 의 전압강하는 3V이다.)\n\n\n① 8           ② 11\n\n③ 12          ④ 14","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":621},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1078}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n다음 설명에 대한 장치는 어떤 것인가?\n\n 변압기 내부에서 발생하는 열에 의한 온도와 외부의\n\n 온도로 인해 절연유의 부피가 수축과 팽창을 반복하게\n\n  되고, 이 현상으로 인해 외부에서 출입하는 공기의\n\n 수분과 산소가 흡수되어 산화 및 침전물의 발생으로\n\n 절연유의 성능과 기능 등의 특성이 저하되는데, 이\n\n 장치는 이런 현상을 방지한다.\n\n\n\n① 콘서베이터      ② 라디에이터\n\n③ 브흐홀츠 계전기    ④ 브리더","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m21-q.webp","width":696,"height":765},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":804}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n3상 유도 전동기의 전압이 3.3kV, 주파수가 60Hz 일\n\n때, 최대토크가 100N⦁m였다. 전압이 6.6kV, 주파수\n\n가 240Hz일 때의 최대토크는 몇 N⦁m인가?\n\n\n① 50          ② 100\n\n③ 200         ④ 400","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1224}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n6극 60Hz의 3상 유도전동기가 운전시 슬립이 0.1인\n\n경우, 전동기의 회전속도는 몇 rpm인가?\n\n\n① 900         ② 990\n\n③ 1080         ④ 1188","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":515},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":658}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n2전력계법으로 3상 부하의 무효전력을 측정하여 한다.\n전력계 의 지시값이 25W, 전력계 의 지시값이\n\n10W일 때, 3상 부하의 무효전력은 몇 Var인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n①           ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m24-q.webp","width":678,"height":964},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m24-e1.webp","width":696,"height":593}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n이상적인 전류원의 전압과 전류의 관계성을 나타낸\n\n그래프로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n\n ①            ②\n\n\n\n\n\n ③            ④","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":918},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1289}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text"